{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人梁嘉琪、劉雅麗、盧頌恩等合演的舞台劇《辦公室劇后》，楊潮凱與李佳芯亦有前往捧場。</p><p>楊潮凱在社交平台分享照片，當中有兩人與梁嘉琪的開心合照，亦有跟一眾演員合照及演員在台上的照片。</p><p>他發文大讚梁嘉琪：「識咗你咁耐真係第一次睇你做舞台劇！</p><p>果然係寶</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T13:23:55.471725+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T13:01:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.151893+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.151893+00:00","content_hash":"ec2a93101d1e1930560da17ececb77ce57dca5add2db3a8bee6088c5a3c39122","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}